              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akalulu akoomukaaga ne kagwa ku Nafutaali, be baana ba Nafutaali ng'ennyumba zaabwe bwe zaali.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
